{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16429","headline":"句 · 王建","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"单于不向南牧马，席萁遍满天山下却公不易胜，莫着外家欺。\n锦江诗弟子，时寄五花牋。\n花烧落第眼，雨破到家程。\n一朝金凤庭前下，当是虚皇诏沈曦。\n宣城四面水茫茫，草盖江城竹夹墙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}